02/1116324876072783872475923.jpeg/S8agxqrgBeEfJ2izDdlssrt_YHGyn6gzBcqEHAXKhBw\"/><figcaption>30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）</figcaption></figure><p>川金會險棋！路透：亞洲盟友疑慮加深　憂美安全承諾生變</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T04:19:12.100157+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2055,"images":24,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}